================================================================================
Rule provenance
================================================================================

The rule table in src/main/kotlin/com/salyvn/foliascan/rules/RuleCatalog.kt states
facts about how Folia behaves. Those facts were established by reading the publicly
available patch set of PaperMC/Folia (https://github.com/PaperMC/Folia, GPL-3.0),
and each rule records the patch file and the class member it was taken from.

No Folia, Paper, CraftBukkit, Bukkit or Minecraft source code is included in,
derived into, or distributed with this project. The rule table references type and
member names and quotes short diagnostic strings from Folia's patches so that every
claim FoliaScan makes can be audited against its source.

tools/extract_folia_throws.py regenerates the underlying dataset from a Folia
checkout. It reads that checkout; it does not copy it.

FoliaScan is an independent project. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or
sponsored by PaperMC, Mojang or Microsoft.

The test fixtures under src/test/kotlin/org/bukkit and
src/test/kotlin/io/papermc are original minimal stand-ins written for this project
so the fixtures compile without the Paper API. They are not Bukkit or Paper code.
